<p class="govuk-body">Before you can use the API, we need to register your application and its callback endpoints. We’ll then give you a client ID and client secret.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">The appropriate body that will use your application must contact DfE and request access on your behalf. If more than one appropriate body will use your application, only one of them needs to make the request.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">The appropriate body must give us your contact details so we can arrange a secure way to send the client credentials directly to you.</p>
